<title>USA: Telescan stake held for trust.</title>
<headline>Telescan stake held for trust.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Glenn, trustee for the Paul Glenn Revocable Trust, said Wednesday the trust holds a 5.49 percent stake in Telescan Inc or 588,861 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Glenn said the latest transactions include the purchase of 320,000 common shares bought between August 23 and October 15 at prices ranging from $6.75 to $7.7125 per share.</p>
<p>The stake is held for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
